fy-center gap-0.5 rounded-lg px-1 py-2 text-[11px] font-medium transition-colors text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-menu size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16"></path><path d="M4 18h16"></path><path d="M4 6h16"></path></svg><span>Več</span></button></div></nav><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Ali potrebujem račun, da načrtujem potovanje?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Ne. Načrt ustvariš, shraniš in deliš povsem brez prijave — deluje anonimno. Prosti račun je neobvezen in doda le zgodovino potovanj na strani Moja potovanja."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Koliko stane uporaba?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Načrtovalec, itinererji, vodiči in deljenje so brezplačni. Platforma zasluži z rezervacijami lokalnih doživetij in prodajo na tržnici — ne s tvojimi podatki."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Kaj če potujem izven Slovenije?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Iskreno: za čezmejna potovanja uporabi generalista (na primer Layla, Wanderlog, Mindtrip) ali klepet z AI. Mi pokrivamo samo Slovenijo — a jo pokrivamo globoko, s preverjenimi lokalnimi podatki."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Kako zanesljivi so tvoji podatki?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Podatke za destinacije urejamo uredniško, cene in odpiralni časi imajo vire, vsak načrt pa gre skozi geo-validacijo z opozorili. Kadar nismo prepričani, piše »preveri pred obiskom«. Metodologija je javna na strani Vir podatkov."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do zdaj sem uporabljal(a) Mindtrip — zakaj preklopiti?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Mindtrip je bil dober generalist; ob preverbi 28. 9. 2026 je bilo celo njihovo spletno okolje (stran, prijava, API) nedosegljivo, o vzroku pa ne moremo soditi. Za slovenska potovanja pri nas dobiš: načrtovanje brez prijave, štiri jezike, preverjene lokalne podatke in rezervacije pri lokalnih ponudnikih. Presodi sam — poskus brez prijave traja 30 sekund."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Kaj se je zgodilo z Mindtripom?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Iskreno: vemo le, kar smo preverili. 28. septembra 2026 je celoten njihov spletni orodnik (mindtrip.ai, prijava, API) prikazoval stran »Under Construction«; o izpadu nismo našli medijske pokritosti, recenzije iz 22.–23. septembra pa jih medtem še uvrščajo med najboljša brezplačna AI orodja za načrtovanje. Ne ugibamo o vzrokih ali prihodnosti — trenutno stanje preveri neposredno pri njih."}}]}</script><main class="mx-auto flex-grow w-full max-w-4xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 lg:px-8"><span data-slot="badge" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md border px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium w-fit whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-3 gap-1 [&amp;&gt;svg]:pointer-events-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive transition-[color,box-shadow] overflow-hidden border-transparent bg-primary text-primary-foreground [a&amp;]:hover:bg-primary/90 mb-4">Iskrena primerjava · brez prijave</span><h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Kateri AI načrtovalec potovanj je pravi za Slovenijo?</h1><p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Ta primerjava ni marketinška brošura. Naše uredniško načelo je iskrenost — zato priznamo, kje so splošni načrtovalci boljši od nas, in pokažemo, kje specialist za Slovenijo vrne več. Odločitev prepustimo tebi.</p><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground/80">Posodobljeno: 28. september 2026. Primerjave staréjo — preveri datum pred odločitvijo.</p><section class="mt-10" aria-labelledby="field-title"><div data-slot="card" class="text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-card border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-50/60 dark:bg-amber-950/20"><div data-slot="card-content" class="p-5 sm:p-6"><span data-slot="badge" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md border px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium w-fit whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-3 gap-1 [&amp;&gt;svg]:pointer-events-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive transition-[color,box-shadow] overflow-hidden [a&amp;]:hover:bg-accent [a&amp;]:hover:text-accent-foreground mb-3 border-amber-500/50 text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-radar mr-1 size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19.07 4.93A10 10 0 0 0 6.99 3.34"></path><path d="M4 6h.01"></path><path d="M2.29 9.62A10 10 0 1 0 21.31 8.35"></path><path d="M16.24 7.76A6 6 0 1 0 8.23 16.67"></path><path d="M12 18h.01"></path><path d="M17.99 11.66A6 6 0 0 1 15.77 16.67"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle><path d="m13.41 10.59 5.66-5.66"></path></svg>Teren · preverjeno 28. 9. 2026</span><h2 id="field-title" class="text-2xl font-bold">Teren se je premaknil — kaj smo živo preverili 28. septembra 2026</h2><p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">Iskrena primerjava zahteva datirane preverbe, ne večne trditve. To so točkovne ugotovitve naših preverb (javni dostop do strani, uradni viri) — ko se teren spremeni, posodobimo to sekcijo.</p><div class="mt-5 space-y-4"><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 dark:bg-amber-900/40 dark:text-amber-200" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-power-off size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18.36 6.64A9 9 0 0 1 20.77 15"></path><path d="M6.16 6.16a9 9 0 1 0 12.68 12.68"></path><path d="M12 2v4"></path><path d="m2 2 20 20"></path></svg></span><div class="min-w-0"><h3 class="font-semibold">Mindtrip: celoten spletni orodnik nedosegljiv</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Ob preverbi 28. 9. 2026 so mindtrip.ai, prijava in API prikazovali stran »Under Construction« (preusmeritev vodi na njihov CDN za slike). O izpadu nismo zasledili medijske pokritosti, recenzije iz 22.–23. 9. pa Mindtrip še navajajo med najboljšimi orodji — recenzijski cikel zaostaja za realnostjo. O vzroku ne ugibamo; trenutno stanje preveri pri njih.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 dark:bg-amber-900/40 dark:text-amber-200" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-alert size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="M12 8v4"></path><path d="M12 16h.01"></path></svg></span><div class="min-w-0"><h3 class="font-semibold">Layla: za marsikaterega obiskovalca za zidom</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">layla.ai je ob naših preverbah vračal napako 429 in varnostno preverjanje brskalnika; nekdanja tržna domena itslayla.com je danes nepovezana modna trgovina. Laylo je 31. 7. 2026 prevzela skupina Expedia — klepet-prvi lijaki v tej kategoriji zdaj stojijo na OTA denarju, kar še ne pomeni boljše izkušnje za vsakega obiskovalca.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 dark:bg-amber-900/40 dark:text-amber-200" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-globe size-4" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20"></path></svg></span><div class="min-w-0"><h3 class="font-semibold">Google: generični AI itinerarji so zdaj brezplačni</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Po uradni časovnici blogov Google (november 2025 → avgust 2026) znata AI Mode in Gemini sestaviti itinerer brezplačno. »AI ti napiše načrt« torej ni več razlika med orodji — globina podatkov, preverljivost virov in uporaba brez povezave so.</p></div></div></div><p class="mt-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">To so točkovne preverbe z datumom — ne stalne trditve. Če se Mindtrip vrne (in upamo, da se), to sekcijo posodobimo; primerjava ostaja poštena v obeh smerih.</p></div></div></section><section class="mt-12" aria-labelledby="generalists-title"><h2 id="generalists-title" class="text-2xl font-bold">Kaj splošni AI načrtovalci delajo odlično</h2><p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">Mindtrip, Layla, Wanderlog, ChatGPT in sorodniki so dobri izdelki (za trenutno dosegljivost glej terensko sekcijo zgoraj). Za naslednje primere je generalist pravilna izbira:</p><div class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"><div data-slot="card" class="bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-card"><div data-slot="card-content" class="p-5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-globe size-6 text-primary mb-2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20"></path></svg><h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Globalna pokritost</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Načrt za Tokio, Lizbono in Patagonijo v istem klepetu. Mi pokrivamo samo Slovenijo.</p></div></div><div data-slot="card" class="bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-card"><div data-slot="card-content" class="p-5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plane size-6 text-primary mb-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17.8 19.2 16 11l3.5-3.5C21 6 21.5 4 21 3c-1-.5-3 0-4.5 1.5L13 8 4.8 6.2c-.5-.1-.9.1-1.1.5l-.3.5c-.2.5-.1 1 .3 1.3L9 12l-2 3H4l-1 1 3 2 2 3 1-1v-3l3-2 3.5 5.3c.3.4.8.5 1.3.3l.5-.2c.4-.3.6-.7.5-1.2z"></path></svg><h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Letalske karte in hoteli</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Integracije z velikimi rezervacijskimi sistemi po celem svetu. Pri nas rezervirate lokalna doživetja in izdelke, ne lete.</p></div></div><div data-slot="card" class="bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-card"><div data-slot="card-content" class="p-5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users size-6 text-primary mb-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><path d="M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744"></path><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg><h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Skupinsko načrtovanje</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Sodelovanje v realnem času z družino ali prijatelji. Mi ponujamo deljenje načrta z anketo, ne skupinsko urejanje.</p></div></div><div data-slot="card" class="bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-card"><div data-slot="card-content" class="p-5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles size-6 text-primary mb-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z"></path><path d="M20 3v4"></path><path d="M22 5h-4"></path><path d="M4 17v2"></path><path d="M5 18H3"></path></svg><h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Zrelost in obseg</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Milijoni uporabnikov in velike baze recenzij. Mi smo mlada platforma z ozkim, a globokim fokusom.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="mt-12" aria-labelledby="problems-title"><h2 id="problems-title" class="text-2xl font-bold">Kje generalisti pri slovenskih potovanjih razočarajo</h2><p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">To niso izmišljene pasti — dokumentirane so v recenzijah AI načrtovalcev (2025–2026) in v naših lastnih testiranjih:</p><div class="mt-5 space-y-4"><div data-slot="card" class="bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-card"><div data-slot="card-content" class="flex gap-4 p-5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert size-5 shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg><div><h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Cene oddaljene od realnosti</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Recenzenti Mindtripa poročajo o cenovnih odstopanjih do 20–30 %. Za mestni oddih je to nadležnost; za vikend s proračunom 300 € je to razlika med dvema dnevoma.</p></div></div></div><div data-slot="card" class="bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-card"><div data-slot="card-content" class="flex gap-4 p-5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert size-5 shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg><div><h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Zaprti objekti v načrtu</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Klasična past: AI vključi atrakcijo v dan, ko je ta zaprta (znan primer: »Louvre je zaprt ob torkih«). Brez preverjanja odpiralnih časov tega ne more vedeti.</p></div></div></div><div data-slot="card" class="bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-card"><div data-slot="card-content" class="flex gap-4 p-5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert size-5 shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg><div><h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Generični seznami znamenitosti</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Isti seznam top-10 za vsakogar. Slovenija je majhna, a lokalna globina — kdaj na Vintgar brez vrste, kje je kremšnita res tista — zahteva specializirane, urejene podatke.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="mt-12" aria-labelledby="table-title"><h2 id="table-title" class="text-2xl font-bold">Primerjava na dlani</h2><div class="mt-5 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border"><table class="w-full min-w-[680px] text-sm"><caption class="sr-only">Primerjava splošnih AI načrtovalcev potovanj s platformo Discover Slovenia AI</caption><thead><tr class="border-b bg-muted/50 text-left"><th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Kaj primerjamo</th><th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Splošni načrtovalci</th><th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Discover Slovenia AI</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="bg-transparent"><th scope="row" class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium">Fokus</th><td class="px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground">Cel svet</td><td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check size-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Samo Slovenija — globoko in preverjeno</span></span></td></tr><tr class="bg-muted/20"><th scope="row" class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium">Račun za shranjevanje načrta</th><td class="px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground">Pogosto zahtevan (Google/Apple)</td><td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check size-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Ni potreben — anonimno shranjevanje in deljenje</span></span></td></tr><tr class="bg-transparent"><th scope="row" class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium">Preverjanje časov in cen</th><td class="px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground">Ni sistematično</td><td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check size-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Viri + opozorila »preveri pred obiskom« + geo-validacija</span></span></td></tr><tr class="bg-muted/20"><th scope="row" class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium">Izvedljivost dneva (razdalje, časi)</th><td class="px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground">Redko preverjena</td><td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check size-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Pravi km in minute iz cestnega usmerjanja, opozorilo ob pretesnem dnevu</span></span></td></tr><tr class="bg-transparent"><th scope="row" class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium">Slovenščina</th><td class="px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground">Angleščina ali strojni prevod</td><td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check size-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>4 jeziki kot jedro izdelka (SL/EN/IT/DE)</span></span></td></tr><tr class="bg-muted/20"><th scope="row" class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium">Rezervacije</th><td class="px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground">Globalni leti in hoteli</td><td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-minus size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path></svg><span>Lokalna doživetja in tržnica s slovenskimi ponudniki</span></span></td></tr><tr class="bg-transparent"><th scope="row" class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium">Načrt brez povezave</th><td class="px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground">Pogosto le v aplikacijah</td><td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check size-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Da — namesti kot aplikacijo (PWA)</span></span></td></tr><tr class="bg-muted/20"><th scope="row" class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium">Potovanja izven Slovenije</th><td class="px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground">Da — cel svet</td><td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-x size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg><span>Ne — odkrito priporočimo generalista</span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Tabela je poštena do obeh strani: zadnja vrstica je priznanje, ne pomanjkljivost, ki bi jo skrivali.</p></section><section class="mt-12" aria-labelledby="practice-title"><h2 id="practice-title" class="text-2xl font-bold">Kaj to pomeni v praksi</h2><ol class="mt-5 space-y-4"><li class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div><h3 class="font-semibold">December, 15:40, Vintgarska soteska</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Generalist lahko sotesko mirno vključi v pozno popoldanski načrt. Naš načrtovalec ve, da pozimi ob 16:00 zapira, in te opozori, naj jo prestaviš dopoldan — z virom podatka.</p></div></li><li class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div><h3 class="font-semibold">Bled → Bohinj »približno 30 minut«?</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Ocene časa »iz spomina modela« znajo odstopati. Povezovalniki med postanki pri nas nosijo dejanske kilometre in minute iz usmerjanja po pravih cestah — vključno z zimskimi odseki.</p></div></li><li class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div><h3 class="font-semibold">Koliko te bo dan res stal?</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Cene vstopnic in lokalnih specialitet črpamo iz urejenega dataseta z viri — vsota na dnevni kartici nekaj pomeni. Kadar podatka ni, to povemo in dodamo opozorilo.</p></div></li></ol></section><section class="mt-12" aria-labelledby="notforyou-title"><div data-slot="card" class="bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-card border-dashed"><div data-slot="card-content" class="p-6"><h2 id="notforyou-title" class="text-xl font-bold">Kdaj Discover Slovenia AI NI pravi zate</h2><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Če načrtuješ potovanje čez mejo, potrebuješ letalske karte ali hotel v tujini — izberi generalista (Layla, Wanderlog ali klepet s ChatGPT/Gemini). To je v redu; tudi mi njih uporabljamo za tuja potovanja. Radi pa te vidimo na slovenskem delu poti.</p></div></div></section><section class="mt-12" aria-labelledby="cta-title"><div data-slot="card" class="text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-card border-primary/30 bg-muted/30"><div data-slot="card-content" class="p-6 sm:p-8"><h2 id="cta-title" class="text-2xl font-bold">Poskusi brez prijave</h2><p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">Od vprašanja do načrta: 30 sekund. Zahtevan račun: nič. Jezik: slovenščina, angleščina, italijanščina ali nemščina.</p><div class="mt-5 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap"><a data-slot="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive bg-primary text-primary-foreground shadow-md ring-1 ring-inset ring-primary-foreground/15 hover:bg-primary/90 hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-px active:translate-y-0 active:shadow-md h-12 rounded-md px-6 has-[&gt;svg]:px-4 md:h-10" href="/nacrtuj">Sestavi moj načrt</a><a data-slot="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive border bg-background shadow-xs hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground dark:bg-input/30 dark:border-input dark:hover:bg-input/50 h-12 rounded-md px-6 has-[&gt;svg]:px-4 md:h-10" href="/destinacije">Razišči destinacije</a><a data-slot="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive border bg-background shadow-xs hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground dark:bg-input/30 dark:border-input dark:hover:bg-input/50 h-12 rounded-md px-6 has-[&gt;svg]:px-4 md:h-10" href="/zemljevid">Odpri zemljevid</a><a data-slot="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive border bg-background shadow-xs hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground dark:bg-input/30 dark:border-input dark:hover:bg-input/50 h-12 rounded-md px-6 has-[&gt;svg]:px-4 md:h-10" href="/nacrtuj#skupnost">Poglej skupnostne načrte</a></div></div></div></section><section class="mt-12" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><h2 id="faq-title" class="text-2xl font-bold">Pogosta vprašanja</h2><div class="mt-5 space-y-6"><div><h3 class="font-semibold">Ali potrebujem račun, da načrtujem potovanje?</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Ne. Načrt ustvariš, shraniš in deliš povsem brez prijave — deluje anonimno. Prosti račun je neobvezen in doda le zgodovino potovanj na strani Moja potovanja.</p></div><div><h3 class="font-semibold">Koliko stane uporaba?</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Načrtovalec, itinererji, vodiči in deljenje so brezplačni. Platforma zasluži z rezervacijami lokalnih doživetij in prodajo na tržnici — ne s tvojimi podatki.</p></div><div><h3 class="font-semibold">Kaj če potujem izven Slovenije?</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Iskreno: za čezmejna potovanja uporabi generalista (na primer Layla, Wanderlog, Mindtrip) ali klepet z AI. Mi pokrivamo samo Slovenijo — a jo pokrivamo globoko, s preverjenimi lokalnimi podatki.</p></div><div><h3 class="font-semibold">Kako zanesljivi so tvoji podatki?</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Podatke za destinacije urejamo uredniško, cene in odpiralni časi imajo vire, vsak načrt pa gre skozi geo-validacijo z opozorili. Kadar nismo prepričani, piše »preveri pred obiskom«. Metodologija je javna na strani Vir podatkov.</p></div><div><h3 class="font-semibold">Do zdaj sem uporabljal(a) Mindtrip — zakaj preklopiti?</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Mindtrip je bil dober generalist; ob preverbi 28. 9. 2026 je bilo celo njihovo spletno okolje (stran, prijava, API) nedosegljivo, o vzroku pa ne moremo soditi. Za slovenska potovanja pri nas dobiš: načrtovanje brez prijave, štiri jezike, preverjene lokalne podatke in rezervacije pri lokalnih ponudnikih. Presodi sam — poskus brez prijave traja 30 sekund.</p></div><div><h3 class="font-semibold">Kaj se je zgodilo z Mindtripom?</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Iskreno: vemo le, kar smo preverili. 28. septembra 2026 je celoten njihov spletni orodnik (mindtrip.ai, prijava, API) prikazoval stran »Under Construction«; o izpadu nismo našli medijske pokritosti, recenzije iz 22.–23. septembra pa jih medtem še uvrščajo med najboljša brezplačna AI orodja za načrtovanje. Ne ugibamo o vzrokih ali prihodnosti — trenutno stanje preveri neposredno pri njih.</p></div></div></section><p class="mt-10 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Primerjava temelji na javno dostopnih recenzijah (2025–2026) in uredniški analizi platforme (september 2026). Več: <a class="text-primary underline" href="/vir-podatkov">vir podatkov</a> · <a class="text-primary underline" href="/zaupanje-in-varnost">zaupanje in varnost</a> · <a class="text-primary underline" href="/o-strani">o strani</a></p></main><footer class="mt-auto w-full border-t border-border bg-muted/30" aria-label="Noga strani"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 pb-48 pt-10 sm:px-6 sm:pb-48 lg:px-8 lg:pt-12 lg:pb-24"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-10 lg:grid-cols-5"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><a class="flex items-center gap-2 text-foreground transition-colors hover:text-primary" aria-label="Discover Slovenia AI — domov" href="#vrh"><span class="flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-primary text-primary-foreground shadow-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-mountain size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m8 3 4 8 5-5 5 15H2L8 3z"></path></svg></span><span class="text-base font-bold tracking-tight">Discover Slovenia AI</span></a><p class="max-w-xs text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Načrtovalec potovanj za Slovenijo in zahodni Balkan z realnimi podatki in determinističnim motorjem. Odkrij 38 destinacij — Bled, Ljubljana, Piran in več.</p></div><nav class="flex flex-col gap-3" aria-label="Razišči"><h3 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-foreground/70">Razišči</h3><ul class="grid grid-cols-2